{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryPriceList\">Inventory Price List</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryPriceList Is On Port Price Reports To ToDate\">The Inventory Price List form configures parameters for price list reports.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Custom InventoryItem InventoryItems Is Item Price Rate Select Settings To ToDate\">Select inventory items and price settings to generate custom price lists.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></summary><div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Is Name Price\">Enter a name for this price list.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"FilterByCustomField\">Filter by custom field</span></summary><div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom CustomField Is Item On To ToDate\">Check this box to show only items that match a specific custom field value.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"CustomField\">Custom Field</span></summary><div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"By Custom CustomField Filter Select To ToDate\">Select the custom field to filter by.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Filter\">Filter</span></summary><div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom CustomField To ToDate\">Enter the custom field value to match.</p></div></details>",
